Package: winning
Type: Package
Title: Win Probabilities and Share Calibration for Factor Probit Races
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Peter", "Cotton", email = "peter.cotton@microprediction.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes all N win probabilities of a factor-structured
    Gaussian race (multinomial probit with low-rank-plus-diagonal
    covariance) in one shared-lattice pass of O(Q*N*L) operations, and
    inverts observed shares to abilities by a damped coordinate Newton
    method with analytic slopes. Conditional on the factors the
    alternatives are independent, so a single shared survival field
    prices every alternative; the same identity appears in Cotton (2021)
    <doi:10.1137/19M1276261> for independent contests.
